# Datasets, corpora, checkpoints and raw run output. All large and reproducible
# from the scripts, so none of them belong in git. The curated, small versions of
# the results live in reports/ and ARE tracked.
# Anchored with a leading slash so they match only these top-level directories,
# while curated evidence under reports/ remains tracked.
/data/
/checkpoints/
/logs/
/results/

# The paper PDF. It is CC-BY 4.0, so redistributing it is permitted -- but the
# repo links to the DOI instead of carrying a 1.2 MB copy. Delete this line if
# you would rather ship it.
3545948.3545956.pdf

